        <mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;b&gt;No block completes the lifecycle at 7d8833d, in either shape:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. p2p subscribes to no gossip topics, so [1] never delivers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. The DA gate [6] never opens: only the P2pStream DataAvailable arm (E2) marks a root available, and p2p never sends it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;IDLE (iff core): needs a checkpoint-synced core; checkpoint_providers defaults to []. Hops 7-11 never run for a new block." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#c9b037;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1100" y="50" width="300" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c28" value="Serving peers [14]: block / column req/resp answer code 3 (STUB); E6 serve reads are DEAD-AS-WIRED. Hop table and code citations: docs/architecture/05-block-lifecycle.md." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1100" y="310" width="300" height="110" as="geometry" />
